{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16217120","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16217120","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1621712001:1":{"text":"손님은 무슨 손님. 밖을 한 바퀴 다 돌아봤는데 그림자도 없더라!","source_cn":"哪有什么客人，我到外面找了一圈，连个影子都没看到！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x300386ED99B550F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1621712002:1":{"text":"죄송해요, 사장님. 제가 착각한 것 같아요.","source_cn":"对不起老板，可能是我看错了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x384CC77970A9A14C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1621712003:1":{"text":"흥... 이건 나중에 따져 묻고.","source_cn":"哼……回头再找你算账。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2097E00E9BDD59A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1621712004:1":{"text":"거기, 학생들! 생각 정리는 끝났나요? 괜히 버티지 말고 얌전히 돈 내시죠? 돈을 내게 할 방법은 얼마든지 있으니까!","source_cn":"你们几个，考虑得怎么样？我劝你们别挣扎了，赶紧乖乖买下...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF194719C17381C7D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1621712005:0":{"text":"저흰 돈 안 낼 거예요.","source_cn":"我们不会付钱的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x095E4095877D15B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1621712006:0":{"text":"저건 계시의 거울이 아니에요. 애초에 골동품도 아니고, 그냥 낡아 보이게 만든 거울일 뿐이잖아요!","source_cn":"因为这根本不是什么启示之镜，甚至都不是古董，只是一件仿...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F9BA37936015838","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1621712007:0":{"text":"뭐라고요? 좋아, 돈 안 내려고 골동품이 가짜라고 모함까지 하다니... 아무래도 작정하고 온 모양이지요?","source_cn":"你说什么？！好啊，你们为了赖账，竟然还敢污蔑我的古董是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x404B3BEF907556D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1621712008:1":{"text":"증거가 있어요!","source_cn":"我们有证据！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3EDCEED707AECC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1621712008":{"text":"증거가 있어요!","source_cn":"我们有证据！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3EDCEED707AECC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1621712009:1":{"text":"진짜 골동품이라면 문양이 자연스럽게 낡으면서 마모됐어야 해요. 입체적이고 또렷하게 보이기도 해야 하고요!","source_cn":"真正的古董镜，表面花纹有自然老化、磨损，花纹模棱立体明确。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15C56C2DCDB41375","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1621712010:1":{"te