,"document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1621712014:1":{"text":"진짜 골동품 거울이라면 뒷면에 세월이 지나면서 자연스럽게 쌓인 먼지라거나, 금속이 산화돼서 변색된 흔적이 있어야 해요.","source_cn":"真正的古董镜，背面通常会因年代久远而出现自然的灰尘堆积...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5DC767BD73994F2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1621712015:1":{"text":"그런데 이 거울의 뒷면은 너무 평평하고 깨끗해요! 새것 같잖아요!","source_cn":"而你的这面镜子，背面干净又平整，跟新的一样！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6852B4B5068A28E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1621712016:1":{"text":"이... 이건...","source_cn":"这……这是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF477B56D990B9F98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1621712017:1":{"text":"그리고 방금 누군가 이 거울을 수리하고 전시했던 적이 있다고 하셨죠? 그렇다면 뒷면에 흔적이 남았어야 하잖아요.","source_cn":"另外，你刚刚提过，有人专门修补、展示过这面镜子。这么说...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6AA42A4F605613E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1621712018:1":{"text":"그 흔적들은 다 어디로 간 건가요?","source_cn":"请问，这些痕迹去哪里了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x019C895FC0D9653B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1621712019:1":{"text":"...정리! 정리해 뒀어요. 큰돈을 들여서 아주 깨끗하게 정리했죠. 이건 전부 모함입니다!","source_cn":"……是我提前清理过了！我花了大价格清理干净，你这是诬陷...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B1B60DA8D659C6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1621712020:1":{"text":"게다가 이게 골동품이 아니라고 해도, 일단은 마법 성물이잖아요?","source_cn":"而且，就算它不是古董镜，但它还是一件价值连城的神奇物品！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE06173F1FC7ABA85","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:25:1621712020":{"text":"게다가 이게 골동품이 아니라고 해도, 일단은 마법 성물이잖아요?","source_cn":"而且，就算它不是古董镜，但它还是一件价值连城的神奇物品！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE06173F1FC7ABA85","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1621712021:1":{"text":"마... 말도 안 돼!","source_cn":"这……这不可能……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF0CD8C6B752CB3A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1621712022:1":{"text":"여기 학생 배지가 있어요. 이래도 납득 못 하겠다면, 교수님에게 감정해 달라고 부탁할게요!","source_cn":"这是我们的学生徽章。你要是还不服的话，我们可以找老师来鉴定！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6027B4B942DCFA2A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_titl